{"_id":"17c2a7dd299d0d53","name":"Mithral Ore","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/stone/ore-chunk-teal.webp","system":{"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Mithral Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of rare mithral-bearing ore from the deep stone around Blingdenstone.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 25 gp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>","chat":"<p><strong>Mithral Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of rare mithral-bearing ore from the deep stone around Blingdenstone.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 25 gp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>"},"price":{"value":25,"denomination":"gp"}},"flags":{"regionwright-hunting-gathering":{"ore":{"version":1,"oreId":"mithral-ore","unitWeight":1,"saleValue":{"value":25,"denomination":"gp"},"tier":"very rare"}}}}
{"_id":"1a9685a36b5a8b42","name":"Silver Ore","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/stone/ore-chunk-silver-gray.webp","system":{"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Silver Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of silver-bearing raw ore. It still needs crushing, sorting, and smelting before it reaches refined silver value.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 2 gp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>","chat":"<p><strong>Silver Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of silver-bearing raw ore. It still needs crushing, sorting, and smelting before it reaches refined silver value.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 2 gp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"}},"flags":{"regionwright-hunting-gathering":{"ore":{"version":1,"oreId":"silver-ore","unitWeight":1,"saleValue":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"tier":"uncommon"}}}}
{"_id":"37e3a853716aedc5","name":"Gold Ore","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/stone/ore-chunk-yellow-gold.webp","system":{"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Gold Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of gold-bearing raw ore. The visible metal is valuable, but much of the mass is still host rock.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 10 gp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>","chat":"<p><strong>Gold Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of gold-bearing raw ore. The visible metal is valuable, but much of the mass is still host rock.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 10 gp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"}},"flags":{"regionwright-hunting-gathering":{"ore":{"version":1,"oreId":"gold-ore","unitWeight":1,"saleValue":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"tier":"rare"}}}}
{"_id":"4d7d05c8ba21acfb","name":"Copper Ore","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/stone/ore-chunk-copper-orange.webp","system":{"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Copper Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of raw copper-bearing ore. Copper-bearing seams are a common, useful find in the caverns around Blingdenstone.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 5 sp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>","chat":"<p><strong>Copper Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of raw copper-bearing ore. Copper-bearing seams are a common, useful find in the caverns around Blingdenstone.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 5 sp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"}},"flags":{"regionwright-hunting-gathering":{"ore":{"version":1,"oreId":"copper-ore","unitWeight":1,"saleValue":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"},"tier":"common"}}}}
{"_id":"4f64e7a1b4c04723","name":"Iron Ore","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/stone/ore-chunk-iron-black.webp","system":{"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Iron Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of raw iron-bearing ore. A practical, common mining resource in the stone around Blingdenstone.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 1 sp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>","chat":"<p><strong>Iron Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of raw iron-bearing ore. A practical, common mining resource in the stone around Blingdenstone.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 1 sp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"sp"}},"flags":{"regionwright-hunting-gathering":{"ore":{"version":1,"oreId":"iron-ore","unitWeight":1,"saleValue":{"value":1,"denomination":"sp"},"tier":"common"}}}}
{"_id":"5d49adb20504f08c","name":"Adamantine Ore","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/stone/ore-chunk-black.webp","system":{"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Adamantine Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of exceptionally hard adamantine-bearing ore. Exceptionally rare deposits can be found in the deepest mineral-bearing stone around Blingdenstone.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 50 gp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>","chat":"<p><strong>Adamantine Ore</strong></p><p>A one-pound chunk of exceptionally hard adamantine-bearing ore. Exceptionally rare deposits can be found in the deepest mineral-bearing stone around Blingdenstone.</p><p><strong>Gathering unit:</strong> 1 lb. <strong>Sale value:</strong> 50 gp per unit in the Blingdenstone gathering economy.</p>"},"price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"}},"flags":{"regionwright-hunting-gathering":{"ore":{"version":1,"oreId":"adamantine-ore","unitWeight":1,"saleValue":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"tier":"very rare"}}}}
